sequenceDiagram
    participant AI as AI Agent<br/>(Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor)
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant WK as .well-known Endpoints
    participant Reg as Trust Registry
    participant Crawler as Crawler / SDK

    Note over AI,Crawler: PATH A: Tool-Based Discovery (AI Clients)

    AI->>MCP: 1. tools/list
    MCP-->>AI: Returns tools including "identify"
    AI->>MCP: 2. Call identify tool
    MCP-->>AI: Returns identity + verification URLs

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over AI: AI evaluates trust from identify response
        AI->>AI: 3a. Check framework.name == "MCPF"
        AI->>AI: 3b. Check credentials.credential_url
        AI->>AI: 3c. Check verification URLs
    end

    Note over AI,Crawler: PATH B: HTTP-Based Discovery (Registries)

    Crawler->>WK: 4. GET /.well-known/did.json
    WK-->>Crawler: Returns DID document

    Crawler->>WK: 5. GET /.well-known/mcp/manifest.json
    WK-->>Crawler: Returns signed manifest

    Crawler->>WK: 6. POST /.well-known/mcp/challenge
    WK-->>Crawler: Returns signed challenge response

    Crawler->>Reg: 7. Verify credential at trust registry
    Reg-->>Crawler: Credential valid + not revoked

    rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
        Note over AI,Crawler: BRIDGE: identify tool returns .well-known URLs
        Note over AI,Crawler: Both paths return CONSISTENT information
    end

    Note over MCP: Single source of truth
    Note over MCP: Tool bridges to HTTP for deeper verification
